  "prefLabel": "Ph 104.01 Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 104.01 Records. Except as exempted by law, all records of the board may be examined by any person at the board office, during weekdays, excluding holidays, from 8:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m.\n\nSource. #6181-A, eff 2-5-96",
